=2 Walkthrough
!Updated marked map woh gates.jpeg|right|Woh Gates
* Examine the spot **Darkened Crevice** in {z:Woh Gates} at the (G-7)/(G-8) border for a cutscene. It is slightly inside a tunnel, just before the downward slope.
** If you're coming from the {z:Kamihr Drifts} entrance, fall down at (I-5) then fall down again at (H-6), and once you're in the big room proceed to the (G-7)/(G-8) border.
** If you're coming from the {z:Marjami Ravine} entrance, follow the left wall the whole way, which will let you skip the Colonization Reive at (H-9), though you'll still need to participate in one at (H-7) to clear the way.
*** Before getting too close to the big room from either route, use Sneak+Invisible **at a distance** (or better yet use {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} & {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164}), as the Bergschrund Gefryst is aggressive toward magic, {m:Metalcruncher Worm} is aggressive to sound, and {m:Serac Rabbit} and Powdery Snoll are aggressive to sight.
* You will receive the {@k} {k:Tuft of golden fur} after this cutscene. This is considered a BCNM entry item, and will be lost upon entry to the upcoming battle.

